+```text
+THEOREM NO-PUSHFORWARD        CONFIRMED, with scope note.
+Measured witness              CONFIRMED: Z (+) Z/2 -> Z after one relator.
+THEOREM CENTRAL-RANK          CONFIRMED.  The r = j branch is impossible.
